\end{gather}
where for $j\in\{1,5\}$, $M^{\Variable_j,\omega} = M^{\Variable_j,\omega}_0-M^{\Variable_j,\omega}_1$.

For all anticommuting $\omega$, let $\eps_\omega = 1 -
